OL,3,AArmed police called after boy hurt near
OL,4,Aschool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said one boy had been taken
OL,7,Fto hospital with minor injuries and
OL,8,Fthere was "no ongoing threat at the
OL,9,Fschool". Both schools have now released
OL,10,Fstudents.
OL,12,FSt Peter's High School pupil Jimmy said
OL,13,Fthe situation was "really scary" and he
OL,14,Fwas still in shock.
